@startuml
[*] --> DisplayProductList
DisplayProductList --> FilterOptions : User selects filter
FilterOptions --> ApplyFilter : User applies filter
ApplyFilter --> DisplayFilteredProducts : Filter applied
DisplayFilteredProducts --> ViewProductDetails : User clicks product
ViewProductDetails --> AddToShoppingList : User adds to list
AddToShoppingList --> DisplayProductList : Return to list
DisplayProductList --> ViewRecommendations : User views recommendations
ViewRecommendations --> DisplayRecommendations : Recommendations displayed
DisplayRecommendations --> ViewProductDetails : User clicks product
DisplayRecommendations --> FilterOptions : User selects filter
DisplayProductList --> ViewReviews : User views reviews
ViewReviews --> DisplayReviews : Reviews displayed
DisplayReviews --> FilterReviews : User filters reviews
FilterReviews --> DisplayFilteredReviews : Reviews filtered
DisplayFilteredReviews --> DisplayProductList : Return to list
DisplayProductList --> [*] : Exit
@enduml
